{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"851195531837308928","content":"\"Oh, I should introduce you.\" She points to her antlers. \"Black one is Orphy. You should already be familiar. And the white one is Eurus. I just named her.\"","created_at":"2021-07-14T11:45:53.718000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"864835091691339806","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"851195531837308928","content":"You notice and Eurus and Seraxa blink at the same time, all the time.","created_at":"2021-07-14T11:46:06.855000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"864835146792173620","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"chinea","id":"740639937677754539","is_bot":0,"username":"franczine"},"author_id":"740639937677754539","channel_id":"851195531837308928","content":"\"Well orphy, you're a bit different, aren't you?\" She reaches out a hand to him. And pets Eurus with the other one.","created_at":"2021-07-14T11:46:32.742000Z","edited_at":"2021-07-14T11:46:47.019000Z","id":"864835255369596978","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"unashaminglyme","id":"340062533304057857","is_bot":0,"username":"unashaminglyme"},"author_id":"340062533304057857","channel_id":"851195531837308928","content":"\"What brings you to the sewer?\"","created_at":"2021-07-14T11:47:33.608000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"864835510660759552","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"chinea","id":"740639937677754539","is_bot":0,"username":"franczine"},"author_id":"740639937677754539","channel_id":"851195531837308928","content":"\"Making my way back to the docks.\" She sits near both of you. \"Been a few days since I last went to look at my ship.\"","created_at":"2021-07-14T11:48:36.541000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"864835774619975727","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"851195531837308928","content":"\"Oh, uh, Meorys, I'm really sorry for leaving you up there yesterday. I should have made more of an effort in making sure you got out.\"","created_at":"2021-07-14T11:48:45.636000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"864835812767957012","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"chinea","id":"740639937677754539","is_bot":0,"username":"franczine"},"author_id":"740639937677754539","channel_id":"851195531837308928","content":"\"Nah, it's alright.\" But her face has the slightest grimace, like a phantom pain is still hurting her. \"Pretty sure I'd done the same.\"","created_at":"2021-07-14T11:49:30.625000Z","edited_at":"2021-07-14T11:49:54.385000Z","id":"864836001465499668","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"unashaminglyme","id":"340062533304057857","is_bot":0,"username":"unashaminglyme"},"author_id":"340062533304057857","channel_id":"851195531837308928","content":"\"Agreed.\" Luard smirks.","created_at":"2021-07-14T11:49:48.246000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"864836075373330462","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"851195531837308928","content":"\"I guess that actually kind of makes us horrible people.\"","created_at":"2021-07-14T11:50:25.167000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"864836230231359530","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"chinea","id":"740639937677754539","is_bot":0,"username":"franczine"},"author_id":"740639937677754539","channel_id":"851195531837308928","content":"Meorys laughs at that.","created_at":"2021-07-14T11:50:41.201000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"864836297483223080","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"unashaminglyme","id":"340062533304057857","is_bot":0,"username":"unashaminglyme"},"author_id":"340062533304057857","channel_id":"851195531837308928","content":"\"Well the more decent people won't be hanging out in the sewers, that's for sure.\"","created_at":"2021-07-14T11:51:01.672000Z","edited_at":"2021-07-14T11:51:07.901000Z","id":"864836383344689192","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
