{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"unashaminglyme","id":"340062533304057857","is_bot":0,"username":"unashaminglyme"},"author_id":"340062533304057857","channel_id":"851195531837308928","content":"\"Kinda.\" Luard sighs. \"Redcoats do suck.\"","created_at":"2021-07-14T11:53:29.729000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"864837004339183616","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"chinea","id":"740639937677754539","is_bot":0,"username":"franczine"},"author_id":"740639937677754539","channel_id":"851195531837308928","content":"\"We could've had more than we do now.\" She gives a *tsk*.","created_at":"2021-07-14T11:54:22.911000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"864837227401445376","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"unashaminglyme","id":"340062533304057857","is_bot":0,"username":"unashaminglyme"},"author_id":"340062533304057857","channel_id":"851195531837308928","content":"\"Had more what?\" Luard inquires.","created_at":"2021-07-14T11:54:38.842000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"864837294221688893","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"851195531837308928","content":"\"What do you mean?\"","created_at":"2021-07-14T11:54:41.367000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"864837304812044319","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"chinea","id":"740639937677754539","is_bot":0,"username":"franczine"},"author_id":"740639937677754539","channel_id":"851195531837308928","content":"\"Weapons, mostly. Had a really fine set of daggers before I came here. Then they took it. Now all I have is this whip.\" She pauses, \"This bow, too, I guess. But I do prefer killing up close.\"","created_at":"2021-07-14T11:57:32.553000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"864838022817644564","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"chinea","id":"740639937677754539","is_bot":0,"username":"franczine"},"author_id":"740639937677754539","channel_id":"851195531837308928","content":"\"-er, hurting.\"","created_at":"2021-07-14T11:57:59.336000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"864838135153164299","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"unashaminglyme","id":"340062533304057857","is_bot":0,"username":"unashaminglyme"},"author_id":"340062533304057857","channel_id":"851195531837308928","content":"\"Ahhh. I see what you mean.\" Luard nods in realization. \"But if you want weapons, there are some shops in the city plus some people sell their weapons, you can try those.\"","created_at":"2021-07-14T11:58:41.150000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"864838310533660673","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"851195531837308928","content":"\"Ohhh. I thought you were talking about having more redcoats.\"","created_at":"2021-07-14T11:58:57.062000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"864838377273425921","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"851195531837308928","content":"\"Well, if it's a weapon you want, you can have my old one.\"","created_at":"2021-07-14T11:59:16.984000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"864838460833792000","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"851195531837308928","content":"She takes out the Sea Farer's Foil. \"It comes with some baggage but that's just mine, and I'd be glad to let it go.\"","created_at":"2021-07-14T12:00:28.107000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"864838759143833611","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"unashaminglyme","id":"340062533304057857","is_bot":0,"username":"unashaminglyme"},"author_id":"340062533304057857","channel_id":"851195531837308928","content":"\"That's pretty convenient.\" Luard remarks in a wide eyed look, shocked at the casual offer. \"You got extras there?\" He jokes.","created_at":"2021-07-14T12:01:25.026000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"864838997880602635","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"851195531837308928","content":"\"Buddy, you got the same gun I did, don't push it.\" She says with a smirk.","created_at":"2021-07-14T12:01:50.716000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"864839105631485963","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"unashaminglyme","id":"340062533304057857","is_bot":0,"username":"unashaminglyme"},"author_id":"340062533304057857","channel_id":"851195531837308928","content":"\"Pardon me.\" Luard bows and returns the smirk.","created_at":"2021-07-14T12:05:05.560000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"864839922867109928","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
